{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01565bQLRRpwoehyyVDK9B58","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Emergency Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## EMG-1 Narrow exception\n4\tFor a **qualifying emergency** purchase totaling **$5,000 or less** from an **approved vendor**, advance finance approval is waived. **Manager approval remains required before proceeding**, and finance must be **notified within 24 hours after purchase**. This exception does not waive any applicable travel-office approval.\n5\t\n6\t## EMG-2 Limits\n7\tThe exception does not apply to a prohibited vendor unless the vendor has received written compliance-officer authorization under VEN-2. Without evidence that the circumstances meet DEF-1, emergency qualification is **not established** and ordinary purchase approvals continue to apply unless additional qualifying facts are supplied.\n8\t\n9\t## EMG-3 Not a blanket authorization\n10\tThe label 'urgent' alone is not sufficient to establish a qualifying emergency. An emergency does not waive manager approval or vendor restrictions.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73ea3532-b1b3-4bbd-b54c-3196945c510d","uuid":"681e0cc8-c763-4ea2-81e5-3ae97d1c747c","timestamp":"2026-10-13T19:22:31.198Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\paradox-sessions-20261013\\CH_FRESH_01\\H4\\03-emergency-policy.md","content":"# Emergency Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## EMG-1 Narrow exception\nFor a **qualifying emergency** purchase totaling **$5,000 or less** from an **approved vendor**, advance finance approval is waived. **Manager approval remains required before proceeding**, and finance must be **notified within 24 hours after purchase**. This exception does not waive any applicable travel-office approval.\n\n## EMG-2 Limits\nThe exception does not apply to a prohibited vendor unless the vendor has received written compliance-officer authorization under VEN-2. Without evidence that the circumstances meet DEF-1, emergency qualification is **not established** and ordinary purchase approvals continue to apply unless additional qualifying facts are supplied.\n\n## EMG-3 Not a blanket authorization\nThe label 'urgent' alone is not sufficient to establish a qualifying emergency. An emergency does not waive manager approval or vendor restrictions.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
